      "final_code": "class Solution:\n    def singleNumber(self, nums):\n        # Step 1: XOR all numbers to get xor of the two unique numbers\n        xor = 0\n        for num in nums:\n            xor ^= num\n        \n        # Step 2: Find a set bit in xor (rightmost set bit)\n        diff = xor & (-xor)\n        \n        # Step 3: Divide numbers into two groups and XOR separately\n        a, b = 0, 0\n        for num in nums:\n            if num & diff:\n                a ^= num\n            else:\n                b ^= num\n        \n        return [a, b]\n",
